<title>DENMARK: Danish Kommunekredit ups 2002 four pct bond amount.</title>
<headline>Danish Kommunekredit ups 2002 four pct bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Kommunekredit raised an existing four percent bond due 2002 by 75 million crowns to 1.958 billion crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by the Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Raaschou said the lead manager was Jyske Bank and the bonds were already sold. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
